{"server":"cn","storyId":"act21side_level_act21side_05_end","groupId":"act21side","stageId":"act21side_05","title":"恒久法则","storyCode":"IS-5","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"78dc4f9ee6cfe01cacaea21755b5e8260f59e02911bff45f34d3edd66a9d51da","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g1_srcstreet"},{"type":"narration","text":"萨卢佐家族周边"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱昂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我向来不会对你的做法指指点点，我希望你能对诸事有自己的判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些年，你做得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的这么想，又为什么......"},{"type":"narration","text":"为什么要在这时突然出手？\n为什么要告诉我那些？\n为什么要......背叛拉维妮娅？\n莱昂图索心中有无数疑问，却发现自己一个都问不出口。\n之前的所见所闻颠覆了他的认知，他忽然觉得，眼前的父亲是陌生的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为，现在是最好的，也是唯一的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会知道的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贝纳尔多先生，莱昂图索先生，恭候多时了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你不是萨卢佐的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"食品安全部部长，卢比奥。为什么你会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚的宴会，将由食品安全部提供食材，并由鄙人亲自下厨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说过，在沃尔西尼，想要举办一场上好的宴会，离不开食品安全部的支持。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您过誉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是希望能提供让每个家族的贵人们都满意的食物罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，今晚的宴会，倒是更让人期待了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g5_srcpark"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他现在在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他去了萨卢佐家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不问为什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能感觉到，贝纳尔多对你来说，很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我当上了这座城市的法官之后，他没有要求我必须像别的法官那样，在立场上维护自己背后的家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他允许我做我自己想做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有莱昂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱昂作为贝洛内家族在这座城市的领导者，他也愿意尊重我的工作，以及我所坚持的公正。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便我将矛头指向贝洛内，他也会公事公办。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用他的话说，就是我的公正比单纯的暴力更有效率。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不讨厌他这种对于公正的理解，他甚至也会闲暇时读一读法律相关的书籍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但即便如此，身为法官，我依然要面对这座城市中时刻在发生的不公。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家族之间的倾轧，家族对普通市民的压迫，普通市民的敢怒不敢言......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我越是想要公正行事，就越意识到自己举步维艰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾经安慰自己，起码并没有成为家族的帮凶，德克萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么可能呢，我的手早就脏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是我还不想承认，脏才是理所当然的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使这在你看来可能是可笑的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贝纳尔多对我的许诺，是我能够在叙拉古坚持担任法官的唯一理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"许诺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他曾经对我说，等到贝洛内家族取得胜利的那一天，他会在叙拉古开辟出一片地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那里，我所相信的律法将不再依托于单纯的权力，我所想要的公平能够真正实现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以在那之前，他希望我能够忍耐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每当我坚持不下去的时候，我就会想到他的承诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说，如果这真的只是一个谎言，那我过去十几年的生活又算是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我想，以他的立场和地位，他没有必要说这种谎言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。所以——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卢佐家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卢佐家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是法官拉维妮娅，关于谋杀卡拉奇的罪犯，我有问题想要找阿尔贝托阁下谈谈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卢佐家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法官阁下......老爷正在宴请贵客，没有时间......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贵客，是指贝纳尔多·贝洛内，是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卢佐家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请转告两位领袖，兹事体大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天，如果见不到两位，我是不会回去的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这道菜，是我从一位莱塔尼亚厨师那里学来的，请诸位品尝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不错，不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时代真是跟过去不一样了啊，贝纳尔多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过去，我们想要一样东西，只会想，我一定要得到它，谁拦着我，我就杀了谁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要找几个和我关系好的官员，或者商人，让他们替我去拿，事情还不能太声张，免得被人发现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多可笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说对吧，卢比奥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......是您的，总是您的，能替您取东西，也是那些人的运气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卢比奥部长能站在这里，想必运气也不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我恰是没有那样的运气，才会选了这样的方法，也不过是一介想要博大佬们欢心的小丑罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你这老小子，也是喜欢妄自菲薄，你能站在这里，足以证明你的价值了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说的是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，贝纳尔多，场面话说了这么多，我们也该说点真心话了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想动那一位，做十二家族一直想做却不敢做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以，我奉陪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，水虽然已经搅浑了，想让那位下场，可远远不够。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你既然敢来赴宴，就说明，现在的局势还在你的掌控中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说吧，你到底想怎么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿尔贝托，你怎么看罗塞蒂家族？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗塞蒂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个家族，野心不小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，罗塞蒂家族能走到今天，可不是单单因为乔万娜自称是萨尔瓦多雷的接班人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许有人真的以为德克萨斯这个姓氏留下的遗产——老萨尔瓦多雷的凝聚力，是一笔了不起的财富。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但在我看来，那根本就是一种负担。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人格魅力，人格魅力，归根结底不过是钱到位了，别人才愿意正眼看你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，也不对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坐在你我这个位置上，总得有些服人的手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平心而论，我倒确实有些佩服乔万娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对她而言，德克萨斯的遗产无疑是一种负担，但她不仅挑起了这个负担，而且确实把它变成了自己的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诚然，罗塞蒂走到今天，靠的是罗塞蒂自己积累的财力和人脉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他们走得有些过头了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你当真觉得，那位想把新的城市交给我们之中任何一个家族？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们这些家族在这座城市里互相争夺至今，罗塞蒂都没有表现出丝毫参与的动静，仿佛他们真的与世无争。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他们可是接过了萨尔瓦多雷遗产的罗塞蒂，他们将建设城市的技术交给叙拉古，难道就当真没有一点想法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对一座为了纪念萨尔瓦多雷而建造的新城市？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且是一座足以改变叙拉古未来格局的新城市？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不妨说得再清楚一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说得再清楚不过了，阿尔贝托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十二家族在这座城市里撕咬至今，对那位来说，不过是一场斗兽的好戏罢了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠诚的家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷......（耳语）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？拉维妮娅法官，还有那个切利尼娜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她们想要见我和贝纳尔多？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贝纳尔多，这是什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她们不是我带来的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卢佐对于客人，向来是欢迎的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但不是客人的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按萨卢佐的规矩来办就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，既然如此，听到了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠诚的家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贝纳尔多，我知道你喜欢和人聊一些局势、一些规划、一些未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我这个人，却更喜欢听一些更加实干的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你对这些东西早已烂熟于胸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人们只记得萨卢佐绝不轻易下注，却几乎都要忘了，萨卢佐绝不轻易松口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卢比奥，接下来没有你的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卢比奥部长，对歌舞剧感兴趣吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......空闲的时候，我也会去看一看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的话，倒是正好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......是《德克萨斯之死》第二幕的票？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，如果你感兴趣，可以去看一看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贝纳尔多，我说过，客套话已经结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想邀请萨卢佐的诸位，一起前往观剧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠诚的家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请回吧，两位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠诚的家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们并不在今天的邀请之列。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我说，我今天非见不可呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠诚的家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卢佐对于不受欢迎的客人，也有相应的待客之道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......切利尼娜，抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是为此而来的，不是吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠诚的家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......对萨卢佐刀剑相向，你疯了吗？切利尼娜，最后的德克萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恰恰相反。"},{"type":"narration","text":"不以杀戮为目的，而是为了一个正直的、真切的愿望出手，这会是回到叙拉古以来，最让她不觉得空虚的一次战斗。\n德克萨斯如此想道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的剧场经理告诉我，罗塞蒂家族预约了明晚那场演出的贵宾包厢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，在剧院里动手，这就是白日剧团著名的艺术总监的做法吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过是在一出戏剧中加入一些名为真实的佐料罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，有一点，我还是有些疑虑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乔万娜的手下，也聚集了来自哥伦比亚的好手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤其是他们在这座城市的代理领袖，瓦拉赫，他的凶名我也有所耳闻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你凭什么断定，你我联手，就能拿下她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激进的家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首领......（耳语）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，这可真是有意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贝纳尔多，那位法官和那个德克萨斯，看来，很想见你啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的手下，已经被她们伤了好几个了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这两位，都是与你贝洛内有渊源的人物，这有些说不过去吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卢佐的家族成员，素来以嗜血好斗闻名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿尔贝托，如果罗塞蒂派人来攻打你的这座家族宅邸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得他们有几分胜算？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们绝无胜算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切利尼娜会是一柄刺穿罗塞蒂的利刃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果罗塞蒂的人进不来的地方，切利尼娜进得来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，你又何须担心，罗塞蒂能够拦得住她？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠诚的家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为你不会承认你在这里生活过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在萨卢佐时的生活还不坏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠诚的家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就更应该知道，你正在做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克萨斯，你......"},{"type":"narration","text":"看着周围昏迷的家族成员，拉维妮娅不禁一时失语。\n在这种情况下，德克萨斯居然还做到了留手，即使和家族打了这么久的交道，这依然有些超出了她的认知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好你不是我的敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，看起来，我们也只能到此为止了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱昂？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......拉维妮娅，你不该来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些话，我必须当面问贝纳尔多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"针对罗塞蒂家族领袖的刺杀已经决定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卢佐和贝洛内会联手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是他的决定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是贝洛内的决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宴会刚刚结束，父亲还在楼上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以去见他，但什么都不会改变。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一路上，拉维妮娅思考了千万种开口的方式。\n她有太多的问题想要质问贝纳尔多。\n她设想过无数种与贝纳尔多争吵的方式，以及结果。\n她以为自己足够愤怒。\n然而，当她踏入房间时，却被眼前的一幕震慑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i15"},{"type":"narration","text":"贝纳尔多端坐在华贵的椅子上。\n他捧着一本装饰着荆棘的法典。\n与她手中的那本如出一辙。\n他低着头，手掌轻轻摩挲着法典，仿佛完全没有注意到——他的双手拂过尖刺，而鲜血缓缓流出。\n纷乱的思绪在此时凝固。\n最终，千言万语凝聚成了一句话——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i15"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"游戏结束了，拉维妮娅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i15"},{"type":"narration","text":"只这一句，对于拉维妮娅来说，已经足够。\n仅仅是几秒钟的沉默，却耗尽了她所有的力气。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i15"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉维妮娅转身离开，没有回头，生怕眼泪夺眶而出。\n贝纳尔多留在原地，不发一言，几颗血珠滴落地面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
